WEBVTT

00:07.482 --> 00:08.758
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:08.862 --> 00:10.448
kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.517 --> 00:12.068
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.137 --> 00:14.000
kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.068 --> 00:17.068
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.137 --> 00:19.103
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.206 --> 00:21.103
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.206 --> 00:23.000
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.068 --> 00:24.931
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.000 --> 00:27.172
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.241 --> 00:29.172
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.241 --> 00:31.103
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.206 --> 00:33.103
kids: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.206 --> 00:35.034
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.103 --> 00:37.172
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.241 --> 00:39.068
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.137 --> 00:40.517
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.586 --> 00:42.241
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.344 --> 00:45.000
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.068 --> 00:47.344
[flute plays]
[长笛演奏]

00:47.413 --> 00:48.758
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:50.413 --> 00:53.310
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:53.379 --> 01:00.448
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:00.517 --> 01:03.517
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

01:05.275 --> 01:07.413
[horn blares]
[喇叭声]

01:07.482 --> 01:09.655
- Good morning, alarm clock.
- 早上好，闹钟。

01:09.758 --> 01:10.931
[horn blares]
[喇叭声]

01:11.000 --> 01:12.137
- Ah.
- 啊。

01:12.241 --> 01:13.724
Whoa!
哇！

01:13.793 --> 01:15.517
Ha!
哈!

01:17.862 --> 01:19.137
Ah.
啊。

01:19.241 --> 01:20.241
Hmm.
唔。

01:20.310 --> 01:22.000
Choices, choices.
选择，选择。

01:22.103 --> 01:24.103
[laughs]
[笑]

01:25.965 --> 01:28.862
Whoa!
哇！

01:28.965 --> 01:30.137
Whoops.
哎呀。

01:30.172 --> 01:31.310
Pants are a little
twisted around.
裤子有点小
扭曲。

01:31.413 --> 01:33.034
Heh.
呵呵。

01:34.655 --> 01:36.172
Ah.
啊。

01:36.275 --> 01:39.137
[trumpet plays]
[喇叭演奏]

01:39.206 --> 01:40.862
Whoa!
哇！

01:48.103 --> 01:49.137
Whoops.
哎呀。

01:49.172 --> 01:52.689
Almost forgot
my lucky tie clip.
差点忘了
我的幸运领带夹。

01:58.172 --> 02:00.931
I'm ready!
我准备好了！

02:01.758 --> 02:06.965
♪ La, la, la, la, la,
la, la, la, la, la, la ♪
♪ 啦，啦，啦，啦，啦，
啦啦啦啦啦啦啦♪

02:08.827 --> 02:11.551
[piano playing]
[钢琴演奏]

02:12.379 --> 02:15.931
Young lady, allow me.
年轻的女士，请允许我。

02:16.034 --> 02:19.000
- Oh, you.
- 哦，你。

02:19.068 --> 02:22.724
[engines droning]
[发动机嗡嗡声]

02:22.827 --> 02:24.896
- Morning, SpongeBob.
- 早上好，海绵宝宝。

02:25.000 --> 02:27.275
- Good morning, Sewer Man.
- 早上好，下水道工。

02:27.344 --> 02:30.517
- There goes one lucky boy.
- 一位幸运的男孩走了。

02:30.586 --> 02:33.724
- See you tomorrow, sweetie.
- 明天见，亲爱的。

02:33.827 --> 02:35.965
- [scatting]
- [分散]

02:36.034 --> 02:37.448
Whoopsie!
哎哟！

02:40.000 --> 02:41.793
- Whoa, whoa.
- 哇哦，哇哦。

02:41.862 --> 02:43.724
- Ah.
- 啊。

02:43.827 --> 02:45.620
Ha-ha.
哈哈。

02:50.275 --> 02:52.241
Good morning, Squidward.
早上好，章鱼哥。

02:52.275 --> 02:53.827
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

02:53.896 --> 02:56.413
And why are you
so peppy this morning?
而你为什么是
今天早上这么精神吗？

02:56.517 --> 02:59.827
- Because today
is my lucky day,
- 因为今天
是我的幸运日，

02:59.896 --> 03:03.310
thanks to my lucky tie clip.
感谢我的幸运领带夹。

03:03.413 --> 03:06.206
- Don't you wear that
tie clip every day?
- 你不穿那个吗
每天都用领带夹吗？

03:06.275 --> 03:07.517
- Uh-huh.
- 呃哈。

03:07.586 --> 03:11.068
Every day is my lucky day.
每一天都是我的幸运日。

03:11.137 --> 03:12.310
- [laughs]
- [笑]

03:12.344 --> 03:14.793
- Pfft, luck isn't real.
- 噗，运气不是真的。

03:14.827 --> 03:16.310
It's all in your head.
一切都在你的脑海里。

03:16.413 --> 03:20.034
- Squidward, it's unlucky
not to believe in luck.
- 章鱼哥，真不走运
不要相信运气。

03:20.103 --> 03:21.965
- Hmph.
- 哼。

03:22.000 --> 03:23.413
- Sorry, Mr. Squidward.
- 对不起，章鱼哥先生。

03:23.482 --> 03:24.862
Didn't see you there.
在那儿没看到你。

03:24.931 --> 03:27.931
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

03:34.793 --> 03:36.689
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

03:43.137 --> 03:46.241
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

03:46.310 --> 03:50.517
One Krabby Patty pickle deluxe,
perfectly prepared.
一份豪华蟹肉饼泡菜，
准备充分。

03:50.586 --> 03:52.310
- Hmm.
- 唔。

03:52.413 --> 03:55.896
I'll be the judge of that.
我将对此做出判断。

03:55.965 --> 03:59.689
[murmuring]
[淙淙]

03:59.758 --> 04:01.724
- Hmm.
- 唔。

04:04.689 --> 04:07.206
I want to complain.
我想投诉。

04:07.275 --> 04:09.896
But it's too delectable!
但这也太赏心悦目了吧！

04:10.000 --> 04:10.931
[cheering]
[欢呼]

04:11.000 --> 04:12.965
- How?
- 如何？

04:13.034 --> 04:16.655
How did you accomplish
such perfection?
你是如何完成的
如此完美？

04:16.724 --> 04:19.379
- Guess I'm just lucky.
- 我想我只是幸运而已。

04:19.482 --> 04:26.448
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:27.689 --> 04:28.827
♪ La, la, la, la ♪
♪ 啦，啦，啦，啦 ♪

04:28.896 --> 04:30.965
Whoa.
哇哦。

04:31.034 --> 04:34.896
Whoa, whoa!
Ah!
哇哦！
啊!

04:35.000 --> 04:37.379
Whoops.
哎呀。

04:38.689 --> 04:40.620
[glass shatters]
[玻璃碎裂]

04:42.379 --> 04:44.827
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

04:44.896 --> 04:47.655
[horn blares]
[喇叭声]

04:47.724 --> 04:50.758
- Ready to start
another lucky day, Gary?
- 准备开始
又是幸运的一天，加里？

04:50.827 --> 04:52.137
- [meows]
- [喵]

04:52.206 --> 04:54.689
- Whoa!
- 哇！

04:57.172 --> 04:59.620
Whoa.
哇哦。

04:59.689 --> 05:01.586
Hey.
嘿。

05:01.689 --> 05:03.413
Huh?
啊？

05:03.517 --> 05:04.931
Ah!
啊!

05:05.034 --> 05:07.275
Where's my lucky tie clip?
我的幸运领带夹在哪里？

05:07.379 --> 05:09.068
Not here.
不在这里。

05:09.137 --> 05:10.034
No.
不。

05:10.103 --> 05:12.103
Nuh-uh.
呃呃。

05:12.137 --> 05:13.413
[toilet flushes]
[厕所冲水]

05:13.448 --> 05:16.241
[blower droning]
[鼓风机嗡嗡声]

05:16.275 --> 05:17.758
[dishes clattering]
[餐具碰撞声]

05:21.517 --> 05:23.068
No!
不！

05:25.379 --> 05:30.103
My lucky tie clip is missing.
我的幸运领带夹不见了。

05:31.758 --> 05:33.758
[cuckooing]
[布谷鸟]

05:33.862 --> 05:35.310
Oh no.
哦不。

05:35.379 --> 05:36.931
I'm late for work.
我上班迟到了。

05:37.034 --> 05:38.310
I'll search for it later.
稍后我会寻找它。

05:38.413 --> 05:41.931
Wah, nah, ah, whoa!
哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！

05:41.965 --> 05:44.275
[screaming]
[尖叫]

05:44.379 --> 05:45.379
[electricity buzzing]
[电声嗡嗡响]

05:45.413 --> 05:47.517
[laughter]
[笑声]

05:50.724 --> 05:52.931
Whoa!
哇！

05:53.000 --> 05:54.931
- Oh, sorry.
- 哦，抱歉。

05:55.000 --> 05:56.620
I was running late today.
我今天迟到了。

05:56.724 --> 05:59.758
Jeez, what bad luck.
哎呀，运气真差。

05:59.827 --> 06:02.724
- Give me your wallet.
Make it snappy.
- 把你的钱包给我。
让它变得活泼。

06:02.793 --> 06:05.758
- Uh, uh.
- 呃，呃。

06:05.827 --> 06:08.586
- See you tomorrow, sweetie.
- 明天见，亲爱的。

06:08.655 --> 06:10.310
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

06:10.344 --> 06:13.137
[screaming]
- Whoopsie.
[尖叫]
- 哎哟。

06:13.172 --> 06:14.655
- Hot dog.
- 热狗。

06:14.758 --> 06:16.655
Get your hot--
让你热起来——

06:17.827 --> 06:19.862
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

06:21.689 --> 06:24.517
[screaming]
[尖叫]

06:25.965 --> 06:27.827
[gasping]
[喘气]

06:27.862 --> 06:29.689
- What happened to you?
- 你怎么了？

06:29.793 --> 06:35.275
- I lost my lucky tie clip, and
now everything is going wrong.
- 我丢失了我的幸运领带夹，并且
现在一切都出了问题。

06:35.344 --> 06:38.275
- [scoffs]
There's no such thing as luck.
- [嘲笑]
没有所谓的运气。

06:38.344 --> 06:40.724
Your dumb tie clip has
nothing to do with it.
你那愚蠢的领带夹有
与此无关。

06:40.793 --> 06:44.551
- Oh, poor naive Squidward.
-哦，可怜的天真的章鱼哥。

06:46.206 --> 06:48.827
Whoa!
哇！

06:48.931 --> 06:50.827
[groans]
[呻吟]

06:54.000 --> 06:57.000
Oh, spatula cramp.
哦，铲子抽筋了。

06:57.103 --> 06:58.275
Aw.
噢。

06:58.344 --> 06:59.586
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

06:59.655 --> 07:01.241
[moans]
[呻吟声]

07:01.344 --> 07:02.689
[screaming]
[尖叫]

07:02.758 --> 07:04.862
[alarm ringing]
[警报响起]

07:04.931 --> 07:05.827
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

07:05.896 --> 07:08.793
- Do you have any
recommendations?
- 你有吗
建议？

07:08.896 --> 07:10.310
- Yeah.
- 是的。

07:10.413 --> 07:12.413
Eat somewhere else.
- Hmm.
去别的地方吃。
- 唔。

07:12.517 --> 07:14.379
Excellent advice.
非常好的建议。

07:14.448 --> 07:16.068
Thank you, young man.
谢谢你，年轻人。

07:16.103 --> 07:17.758
- A tip?
- 小费？

07:17.827 --> 07:19.965
Must be my lucky day.
一定是我的幸运日。

07:20.068 --> 07:22.931
Not that I believe
in that nonsense.
不是我相信的
在那废话中。

07:22.965 --> 07:25.551
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

07:25.620 --> 07:28.689
One Krabby Patty combo.
一份蟹肉饼组合。

07:28.758 --> 07:29.758
- Hmph.
- 哼。

07:29.827 --> 07:32.000
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

07:34.448 --> 07:36.275
Hmm.
唔。

07:36.344 --> 07:39.862
The soda is flat,
the fries are oily,
苏打水是平的，
薯条很油腻，

07:39.931 --> 07:45.034
and the Krabby Patty is bland.
蟹肉饼很平淡。

07:45.103 --> 07:47.758
- B-b-b-bland?
- 平淡平淡？

07:47.862 --> 07:50.206
[groans]
[呻吟]

07:50.275 --> 07:52.068
- What's the matter
with you, boyo?
- 怎么了
和你在一起吗，男孩？

07:52.103 --> 07:55.000
- Aw, I'm bad luck, Mr. Krabs.
- 哦，我运气不好，蟹老板。

07:55.068 --> 07:57.241
Bad luck.
厄运。

07:57.344 --> 07:58.655
- Bad luck?
- 运气不好？

07:58.758 --> 08:01.275
The restaurant
business runs on luck.
餐厅
生意靠运气。

08:01.344 --> 08:06.241
If bad luck sets in,
the Krusty Krab is doomed.
如果运气不好的话
蟹堡王注定要失败。

08:06.310 --> 08:07.344
Everyone out!
大家都出去吧！

08:07.379 --> 08:08.517
Out, out, out, out, out.
出去，出去，出去，出去，出去。

08:08.586 --> 08:10.586
I got to burn some
dried kelp and cleanse
我得烧一些
干海带并洗净

08:10.655 --> 08:12.862
this joint of any bad mojo.
这个关节有任何不好的魔力。

08:12.931 --> 08:14.310
[panicked gasping]
[惊慌地喘气]

08:14.379 --> 08:15.827
- SpongeBob!
Squidward!
- 海绵宝宝！
章鱼哥！

08:15.896 --> 08:19.827
Take the day off.
- Day off?
请一天假。
- 休息日？

08:19.931 --> 08:21.482
No!
不！

08:21.586 --> 08:24.000
- Yes!
- 是的！

08:24.034 --> 08:25.793
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

08:25.862 --> 08:29.689
I hope my good luck went
to someone who needed it.
我希望我的好运过去了
给需要它的人。

08:29.758 --> 08:31.931
- [laughs]
Huh?
- [笑]
啊？

08:32.000 --> 08:33.103
[awed tone]
[敬畏的语气]

08:33.172 --> 08:35.137
A hair?
一根头发？

08:35.206 --> 08:38.551
Maybe I'm getting
SpongeBob's good luck.
也许我正在得到
海绵宝宝祝你好运。

08:38.620 --> 08:41.379
Ya, ta, ta, ta,
ya, ta, ta, ta.
呀，他，他，他，
呀，他，他，他。

08:42.655 --> 08:45.586
- Hey, Patrick.
- Hey, SpongeBob!
- 嘿，帕特里克。
- 嘿，海绵宝宝！

08:45.655 --> 08:47.448
You OK?
你还好吗？

08:47.517 --> 08:50.620
- I lost my lucky tie clip.
- 我丢失了我的幸运领带夹。

08:50.689 --> 08:54.482
I am now the unluckiest
person alive.
我现在是最不幸的一个
人还活着。

08:54.586 --> 08:56.482
Can I have a hug?
我可以拥抱一下吗？

08:56.586 --> 08:58.655
- No, thank you.
- 不，谢谢。

08:58.724 --> 09:01.965
I wouldn't touch you
with a 10-foot pole.
我不会碰你
用一根 10 英尺长的杆子。

09:02.034 --> 09:05.655
I don't want your bad luck
to rub off on me.
我不想让你运气不好
来影响我。

09:05.724 --> 09:08.620
- Oh, what am I going to do?
- 哦，我该怎么办？

09:08.689 --> 09:09.931
- Hmm.
- 唔。

09:10.034 --> 09:13.172
Why don't you find
a new lucky charm?
你为什么不找
新的幸运符？

09:14.206 --> 09:15.724
- Great idea.
- 好主意。

09:15.793 --> 09:17.172
Thanks, Patrick.
谢谢，帕特里克。

09:17.241 --> 09:18.551
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

09:18.620 --> 09:20.413
- I don't know what
I'd do without you,
- 我不知道什么
没有你我也行

09:20.482 --> 09:23.655
my lucky 11-foot pole.
我幸运的 11 英尺长的杆子。

09:23.724 --> 09:25.206
[kissing]
[接吻]

09:26.724 --> 09:29.482
- Lucky, lucky, lucky, lucky.
- 幸运，幸运，幸运，幸运。

09:29.551 --> 09:31.517
Oh, a four-leaf kelp.
哦，四叶海带。

09:31.586 --> 09:33.586
They're really lucky.
他们真的很幸运。

09:38.206 --> 09:41.344
- [screams]
A new freeway?
- [尖叫]
一条新的高速公路？

09:41.413 --> 09:43.310
That's not lucky.
这并不幸运。

09:43.379 --> 09:46.517
Ow, ow.
噢，噢。

09:47.724 --> 09:49.758
A sea bunny's foot.
海兔的脚。

09:49.862 --> 09:51.758
They're extra lucky.
他们格外幸运。

09:51.827 --> 09:53.862
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

09:53.931 --> 09:58.689
- Unless it's still
attached to the sea bunny.
- 除非它还在
附着在海兔身上。

09:58.758 --> 09:59.724
[screaming]
[尖叫]

09:59.827 --> 10:02.620
Sorry.
对不起。

10:02.689 --> 10:04.413
[thunder crashing]
[雷霆轰鸣]

10:05.344 --> 10:06.793
[groans]
[呻吟]

10:06.862 --> 10:09.689
[chatter]
[喋喋不休]

10:09.758 --> 10:11.517
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

10:11.586 --> 10:12.724
Huh?
啊？

10:12.827 --> 10:15.206
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

10:15.241 --> 10:17.241
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

10:17.344 --> 10:20.379
[cheering]
[欢呼]

10:25.103 --> 10:30.551
- Some people have all the
luck, SpongeBob, just not you.
- 有些人拥有所有
海绵宝宝，运气好，只是不是你。

10:30.620 --> 10:32.586
[laughter]
[笑声]

10:32.655 --> 10:35.655
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

10:42.310 --> 10:43.379
Huh?
啊？

10:43.448 --> 10:45.724
My tie clip?
我的领带夹？

10:45.793 --> 10:48.103
I had it with me all day?
我整天都带着它吗？

10:48.206 --> 10:51.172
Huh, it was just
like Squidward said.
呵呵，本来就是
正如章鱼哥所说。

10:51.241 --> 10:53.551
Hey, Squidward, you were right.
嘿，章鱼哥，你是对的。

10:53.586 --> 10:55.379
Luck was all just in my head.
运气只在我的脑海里。

10:55.413 --> 10:58.862
I don't need this solid
gold lucky tie clip.
我不需要这个固体
金色幸运领带夹。

10:58.896 --> 11:00.517
[whistles]
[口哨声]

11:01.965 --> 11:06.068
But it never hurts
to be on the safe side.
但它永远不会痛
为了安全起见。

11:06.137 --> 11:08.931
[laughter]
[笑声]

11:08.965 --> 11:14.586
♪
♪
♪
♪

11:14.655 --> 11:17.620
Hey, Squidward,
my good luck is back.
嘿，章鱼哥，
我的好运又回来了。

11:17.724 --> 11:19.758
Back in my head.
回到我的脑海里。

11:19.793 --> 11:21.344
- Hold on.
- 坚持，稍等。

11:21.448 --> 11:24.551
If SpongeBob's luck
is back, then--
如果海绵宝宝运气好的话
回来了，那么——

11:24.620 --> 11:27.103
[playing discordantly]
[演奏不和谐]

11:27.137 --> 11:30.172
[booing, jeering]
[嘘声、嘲笑声]

11:31.965 --> 11:34.482
Oh, no.
哦，不。

11:43.379 --> 11:45.689
Just my luck.
只是我的运气。

11:48.724 --> 11:51.620
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

11:51.689 --> 11:58.758
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:00.103 --> 12:03.206
[laughter]
[笑声]

12:07.034 --> 12:09.275
- Ooh, you got him, Patrick.
- 哦，你抓住了他，帕特里克。

12:09.310 --> 12:11.413
- You're mine now, jelly!
- 你现在是我的了，果冻！

12:11.517 --> 12:13.275
[grunts]
[咕哝]

12:13.379 --> 12:16.344
[snoring]
[打鼾]

12:25.413 --> 12:27.137
[snoring]
[打鼾]

12:27.241 --> 12:28.241
[gasping]
[喘气]

12:28.344 --> 12:29.448
Huh?
啊？

12:29.551 --> 12:31.482
How long was I out?
我出去多久了？

12:34.034 --> 12:35.758
- About a week.
- 大约一周。

12:35.862 --> 12:37.689
- Whoo, a new record!
- 哇，新纪录！

12:37.758 --> 12:38.931
[laugh]
[笑]

12:39.034 --> 12:43.172
Yeah, it's all
in the old wrist.
是啊，就这样了
在老手腕上。

12:43.241 --> 12:44.517
[snoring]
[打鼾]

12:44.586 --> 12:46.896
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

12:48.310 --> 12:54.103
Ah, nothing like a day
of napping to tucker you out.
啊，没有什么比一天
打盹让你精疲力尽。

12:54.172 --> 12:56.482
Good night, Mr. Lamp.
晚安，灯先生。

12:58.413 --> 13:01.448
Huh, not sleeping yet.
呵呵，还没睡呢。

13:01.517 --> 13:03.862
Oh, maybe if I lay this way.
哦，也许如果我这样躺着的话。

13:05.793 --> 13:08.344
[groaning]
[呻吟]

13:12.448 --> 13:16.724
I guess I'll just sit up
and wait to get sleepy.
我想我会坐起来
并等待困倦。

13:16.793 --> 13:17.862
Hmph.
哼。

13:21.482 --> 13:22.965
[groans]
[呻吟]

13:23.034 --> 13:26.379
I've been waiting
to sleep all day!
我一直在等待
睡一整天！

13:26.482 --> 13:29.965
Oh, it's already
half past a freckle.
哦，已经是了
雀斑过去了一半。

13:30.034 --> 13:32.931
Guess I'll see what
SpongeBob's doing.
我猜我会看到什么
海绵宝宝在做。

13:35.206 --> 13:37.620
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

13:39.000 --> 13:40.827
- Want to hang out?
- 想出去玩吗？

13:40.896 --> 13:42.931
- Oh, Patrick, it's you.
- 哦，帕特里克，是你。

13:43.000 --> 13:44.827
What are you doing
here so late?
你在做什么
这么晚了？

13:44.862 --> 13:46.241
- I can't sleep.
- 我睡不着。

13:46.310 --> 13:48.000
Let's do stuff!
我们来做事吧！

13:48.068 --> 13:53.448
- Um, OK, sure, but I have
to be up in four hours.
- 嗯，好吧，当然，但我有
四小时后起床。

13:53.482 --> 13:54.862
- Perfect!
- 完美的！

13:54.931 --> 13:55.965
- Whoa!
- 哇！

13:56.034 --> 13:57.655
[bright music]
[明亮的音乐]

13:57.724 --> 14:00.655
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

14:00.689 --> 14:03.586
I can't believe
you're beating me!
我不敢相信
你在打我！

14:05.827 --> 14:07.448
Uh.
呃。

14:09.586 --> 14:11.586
You win again?
你又赢了？

14:11.689 --> 14:13.379
All right.
好的。

14:13.413 --> 14:15.724
Best 200 out of 300.
300 名中最好的 200 名。

14:15.793 --> 14:19.034
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

14:19.896 --> 14:23.310
- First one to dig
to rock bottom wins.
- 第一个挖的
到最低点获胜。

14:25.793 --> 14:28.655
Dum, dum, dum, dum, dum, dum.
达姆，达姆，达姆，达姆，达姆，达姆。

14:28.724 --> 14:32.103
[babbling]
[胡说]

14:32.206 --> 14:34.241
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

14:37.896 --> 14:40.068
Patrick, this is
really fun and all,
帕特里克，这是
真的很有趣，

14:40.137 --> 14:42.310
but I need to get to bed.
但我需要去睡觉了。

14:42.379 --> 14:45.344
- But I still can't sleep.
- 但我还是睡不着。

14:45.413 --> 14:48.827
- Patrick, you've got to get
some sleep and fast, or else
- 帕特里克，你必须得到
一些睡眠和禁食，否则

14:48.896 --> 14:51.172
you could start seeing things.
你可以开始看到事物。

14:51.241 --> 14:52.896
- Wait.
- 等待。

14:52.965 --> 14:55.103
I'm seeing things now.
我现在看到了一些事情。

14:55.172 --> 14:57.034
House.
Ground.
房子。
地面。

14:57.103 --> 14:58.241
Sky!
天空！

14:58.310 --> 15:00.793
Make it stop, SpongeBob!
让它停止吧，海绵宝宝！

15:00.896 --> 15:02.862
Make it stop.
让它停止。

15:03.965 --> 15:05.793
- Don't worry, pal.
-别担心，朋友。

15:05.827 --> 15:06.862
I'll help you get to--
我会帮助你到达——

15:06.931 --> 15:08.724
[snoring]
[打鼾]

15:08.793 --> 15:10.724
- Hey, that's my sleep.
- 嘿，这就是我的睡眠。

15:10.793 --> 15:12.344
- Huh?
- 啊？

15:12.413 --> 15:14.620
[groans]
Sleep.
[呻吟]
睡觉吧。

15:17.275 --> 15:22.206
All you need is a good
tucking in and some warm milk.
你所需要的只是一个好的
吃点热牛奶。

15:28.655 --> 15:31.137
And some chamomile tea.
还有一些甘菊茶。

15:32.413 --> 15:33.896
[pop]
[流行音乐]

15:33.965 --> 15:37.413
And my favorite lullaby.
还有我最喜欢的摇篮曲。

15:37.482 --> 15:40.379
[soft music]
[轻音乐]

15:40.448 --> 15:47.482
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

15:53.586 --> 15:56.000
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

15:57.241 --> 16:00.172
- SpongeBob,
I still can't sleep.
- 海绵宝宝，
我还是睡不着。

16:00.275 --> 16:02.000
Huh?
啊？

16:03.724 --> 16:08.172
Oh, looks like I'll have to
do this the old-fashioned way.
哦，看来我得
用老式的方法来做。

16:16.206 --> 16:19.034
Oh, I'm still awake.
哦，我还醒着。

16:25.000 --> 16:27.482
Still awake.
还醒着。

16:31.448 --> 16:33.172
[grunts]
[咕哝]

16:35.586 --> 16:39.862
I think it's working.
我认为它正在发挥作用。

16:39.965 --> 16:41.689
No.
不。

16:41.793 --> 16:43.241
Ugh.
啊。

16:43.344 --> 16:49.068
I didn't want to do this,
but I'm down to my last resort.
我本来不想这样做
但我已经采取了最后的手段。

16:55.724 --> 16:57.413
- Hi, Squidward.
- 嗨，章鱼哥。

16:57.517 --> 17:00.103
- Patrick, what could
you possibly want
- 帕特里克，什么可以
你可能想要

17:00.172 --> 17:02.172
at this hour of the night?
深夜这个时候？

17:02.241 --> 17:03.448
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

17:03.482 --> 17:06.448
I need to hear your life story.
我需要听听你的人生故事。

17:06.482 --> 17:08.655
- Just as I thought,
an idiotic--
——正如我所想的那样，
一个白痴——

17:08.724 --> 17:09.758
what?
什么？

17:09.827 --> 17:12.551
You need to hear my life story?
你需要听听我的人生故事吗？

17:12.620 --> 17:14.275
- Yep.
- 是的。

17:15.724 --> 17:18.689
- Well, it's such short notice.
- 好吧，通知这么短。

17:18.758 --> 17:21.379
I don't have anything prepared,
我什么都没有准备

17:21.448 --> 17:24.965
except this rough manuscript.
除了这份粗糙的手稿。

17:25.068 --> 17:30.413
I call it "Tentacles:
Eight Legs, Eight Lives."
我称之为“触手：
八条腿，八条命。”

17:33.758 --> 17:35.827
- But you only have four legs.
- 但你只有四条腿。

17:35.896 --> 17:37.758
- And two arms.
- 还有两只手臂。

17:37.793 --> 17:39.482
- Oh, yeah.
- 哦，是的。

17:39.551 --> 17:40.793
Yeah, that makes eight.
是的，那就是八个。

17:40.862 --> 17:42.758
- [clears throat]
Chapter 1.
- [清喉咙]
第一章。

17:42.827 --> 17:45.655
"In my youth,
my brilliance was evident.
“在我的青春里，
我的才华是显而易见的。

17:45.758 --> 17:50.000
"Instead of wasting my time
making friends, I made art.
“与其浪费我的时间
交朋友，我创造艺术。

17:50.103 --> 17:53.448
"I recall making a rather
sophisticated tentacle painting
“我记得做了一个相当
精致的触手画

17:53.551 --> 17:54.758
that even my teacher--"
就连我的老师——”

17:54.862 --> 17:56.103
- Wait a minute.
- 等一下。

17:56.206 --> 17:57.724
I'm not getting sleepy.
我不困了。

17:57.793 --> 18:00.103
I'm just getting bored.
我只是觉得无聊了。

18:00.172 --> 18:02.172
- "--and perplexity
as I was bequeathed
——”——以及困惑
正如我被遗赠的那样

18:02.241 --> 18:05.793
an award for my achievements."
对我的成就的奖励。”

18:05.862 --> 18:06.931
- Huh.
- 嗯。

18:07.000 --> 18:09.758
Well, at least
my pipe works for him.
嗯，至少
我的烟斗为他工作。

18:12.965 --> 18:15.310
If I'm not sleepy,
如果我不困的话

18:15.344 --> 18:19.310
I'll just have
to tire myself out.
我只要
让自己疲惫不堪。

18:19.413 --> 18:22.551
Oh, a hot dog!
哦，热狗！

18:22.620 --> 18:24.310
Give me!
给我！

18:24.379 --> 18:27.827
[laughing]
[笑]

18:29.931 --> 18:32.724
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

18:32.793 --> 18:34.620
Give me.
给我。

18:34.655 --> 18:35.965
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

18:36.034 --> 18:38.551
Ah!
啊!

18:38.620 --> 18:43.413
I've got you now,
you little old man.
我现在已经拥有你了
你这个小老头。

18:43.482 --> 18:47.448
- You want to see
a picture of my grandkids?
- 你想看
我孙子的照片？

18:50.310 --> 18:52.275
- [laughing]
- [笑]

18:52.344 --> 18:54.655
- Uh, hi, Patrick.
- 呃，嗨，帕特里克。

18:54.758 --> 18:56.758
Still not sleeping, huh?
还没睡吧？

18:56.827 --> 18:59.862
- How can you tell?
- 你怎么知道？

18:59.931 --> 19:01.517
- Just a hunch.
[laughs]
- 只是一种预感。
[笑]

19:01.586 --> 19:04.931
Looks like you need
a visit from the Sandman.
看起来你需要
睡魔来访。

19:05.034 --> 19:06.586
He'd blow a little
sand in your eyes,
他会吹一点
眼睛里进了沙子，

19:06.689 --> 19:08.827
and you'd be out like a light.
你就会像一盏灯一样消失。

19:08.896 --> 19:12.172
- A Sandman.
[laughs]
- 沙人。
[笑]

19:12.241 --> 19:15.482
Eyes, out like a light!
眼睛，像光一样！

19:15.551 --> 19:18.344
[maniacal laughter]
[疯狂的笑声]

19:19.896 --> 19:22.344
- OK.
See you later.
- 好的。
稍后见。

19:25.862 --> 19:27.310
- [laughing]
- [笑]

19:27.379 --> 19:29.827
Me make Sandman.
我制作桑德曼。

19:29.896 --> 19:32.620
[laughter]
[笑声]

19:32.689 --> 19:36.241
[spooky music]
[诡异的音乐]

19:36.310 --> 19:39.103
OK, Mr. Sandman.
好的，桑德曼先生。

19:39.172 --> 19:44.724
Now blow sand in my eyes
and put me to sleep.
现在把沙子吹进我的眼睛里
并让我入睡。

19:44.827 --> 19:46.206
What's wrong?
怎么了？

19:46.241 --> 19:48.379
You need more sand?
你需要更多的沙子吗？

19:48.413 --> 19:50.448
- [laughing]
- [笑]

19:50.517 --> 19:52.448
- Huh?
- 啊？

19:52.517 --> 19:53.758
Gah!
嘎！

19:53.862 --> 19:56.379
- [laughing]
- [笑]

19:56.448 --> 19:58.275
- Get back here!
- 回到这里！

19:58.379 --> 20:01.482
- Ooh, you'll have
to catch me first.
- 哦，你会有
先抓住我。

20:01.551 --> 20:04.862
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

20:08.344 --> 20:11.034
- Whee!
- 呼！

20:11.068 --> 20:12.034
[car alarm blaring]
[汽车警报器响]

20:12.068 --> 20:15.379
- Hey, cool, a raving lunatic.
- 嘿，酷，一个疯狂的疯子。

20:15.448 --> 20:21.137
- I'll chase you to the ends
of the ocean, Sandman!
- 我会追你到底
海洋的沙人！

20:21.206 --> 20:22.379
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

20:22.413 --> 20:24.379
Gah!
嘎！

20:24.413 --> 20:27.586
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

20:27.689 --> 20:30.172
- Finally.
- 最后。

20:30.241 --> 20:32.344
Oh, oh, that's it.
哦，哦，就是这样。

20:32.413 --> 20:34.896
Keep it coming.
继续吧。

20:37.275 --> 20:39.241
Oh, where are you going?
哦，你要去哪里？

20:39.275 --> 20:40.413
- [laughing]
- [笑]

20:40.482 --> 20:42.862
- I'm not sleepy yet!
- 我还没睡！

20:47.241 --> 20:48.724
- Meow!
- 喵！

20:48.793 --> 20:51.103
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

20:51.206 --> 20:53.379
- Come on.
More!
- 快点。
更多的！

20:54.827 --> 20:56.965
Where are you going?
你要去哪里？

21:03.034 --> 21:05.620
Better.
But I need more!
更好的。
但我需要更多！

21:05.655 --> 21:08.344
- Ooh-hoo!
- 哦呼！

21:08.413 --> 21:10.275
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

21:10.344 --> 21:13.310
- [laughing]
- [笑]

21:13.413 --> 21:15.172
[blows raspberry]
[吹覆盆子]

21:18.344 --> 21:23.310
- Sandman, your stupid
sleep sand doesn't work!
- 桑德曼，你这个傻瓜
睡沙没用！

21:23.413 --> 21:25.034
- Patrick, stop!
- 帕特里克，停下来！

21:25.103 --> 21:26.310
That's no Sandman.
那不是桑德曼。

21:26.413 --> 21:27.896
That's Squidward.
那是章鱼哥。

21:27.965 --> 21:30.137
- Ay, ay.
- 哎呀。

21:30.172 --> 21:33.758
[groaning]
[呻吟]

21:33.827 --> 21:35.172
- Oops.
- 哎呀。

21:35.241 --> 21:36.413
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

21:36.482 --> 21:37.965
Hmph.
哼。

21:38.000 --> 21:41.000
Another misadventure
for my memoir.
又是一次不幸的遭遇
为了我的回忆录。

21:41.034 --> 21:42.931
- It's no use, SpongeBob.
- 这没有用，海绵宝宝。

21:43.000 --> 21:47.000
All the Sandman's sand
couldn't make me sleepy.
所有沙人的沙子
无法让我昏昏欲睡。

21:49.724 --> 21:56.034
I guess I'll just be awake
for the rest of my life.
我想我会醒来
我的余生。

21:56.137 --> 21:58.275
- Oh, aha.
- 哦，啊哈。

21:58.344 --> 22:00.655
If you're going
to be awake forever,
如果你要去的话
永远保持清醒，

22:00.689 --> 22:03.551
then you might as well
put that to good use.
那么你也可以
充分利用它。

22:03.620 --> 22:05.862
- [laughs]
- [笑]

22:05.931 --> 22:08.275
SpongeBob, you were right.
海绵宝宝，你是对的。

22:08.379 --> 22:11.793
My "awakeyness"
makes me the perfect
我的“清醒”
让我变得完美

22:11.862 --> 22:15.379
all-night long-haul trucker.
通宵长途卡车司机。

22:15.448 --> 22:17.379
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

22:17.413 --> 22:19.206
- 10-4, good buddy.
- 10-4，好哥们。

22:19.275 --> 22:21.517
- All right,
keep your rubber side down
- 好吧，
将橡胶面朝下

22:21.586 --> 22:23.793
and the bugs off your glass.
以及玻璃上的虫子。

22:23.862 --> 22:25.137
I'll catch you on the flip.
我会立刻抓住你。

22:25.206 --> 22:26.310
[snoring]
[打鼾]

22:26.379 --> 22:29.413
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

22:36.965 --> 22:40.275
- [laughing]
- [笑]

22:43.275 --> 22:46.172
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

22:46.275 --> 22:53.275
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪